: \"\",\n  \"vehicle\": \"\",\n  \"getting_there\": \"\",\n  \"description\": \"The only legal lottery in Utah\",\n  \"description_html\": \"<p>The only legal lottery in Utah</p>\",\n  \"additional_info\": \"GRIND 89 FLORY LOBAR WAVE LOTTERY ORIENTATION VISITOR CENTER 76 S 1 TOO E 0 0 KANAB CONVENTION CENTER NORTH COYOTE BUTTES (The Wave) pick up permits 6-8:30 am safety briefing 9:00 am 89A • Due to the fragile nature of the area a permit is required for hiking South Coyote Buttes and North Coyote Buttes \\\"The Wave\\\". SOUTH COYOTE BUTTES pick up permit 9:00 am safety briefing 9:15 am • North Coyote Buttes walk-in is limited to 4 groups or 16 people which ever is drawn first. • South Coyote Buttes is 10 permits a day • Permits are drawn by online lottery at Rec.gov • Pick up permits at Kane County Office of Tourism/8 S. 100 E. KANAB MARICALLY UNSPOILED... PROCESS: Day 1: Apply at 6 am to 6pm. You will be notified by email that\'s sent out at 7:15 pm. Accept by 8 am. Day 2: Complete acceptance by 8 am, pick up at 8 am (Tourism Office) and 8:30 am safety briefing. Day 3: Hike the North or South Coyote Buttes whichever permit you won. VisitSouthernUtah.com 435 644-5033\"\n}','2023-09-22 02:50:29','2023-09-22 02:56:18');
